Z FUTBOL

Z FUTBOL is based on League-Soccer. Credit for League-Soccer goes to
awest813 and the contributors who developed and maintained the game.
Upstream project: https://github.com/awest813/League-Soccer
Contributor history: https://github.com/awest813/League-Soccer/graphs/contributors

League-Soccer builds on Gameplay Football, originally created by
Bastiaan Konings Schuiling (Properly Decent), and incorporates work from
Google Research Football by the Google Research Football team and its
contributors.
Gameplay Football: https://github.com/BazkieBumpercar/GameplayFootball
Google Research Football: https://github.com/google-research/football

The in-game Credits screen lists individual contributions to the original
game, including programming, artwork, animation and sound. The upstream
license is included in LICENSE.
